'''Oricorio''' (Japanese: '''オドリドリ''' ''Odoridori'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

