==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Oricorio}} in its {{form|Oricorio|Pom-Pom Style}}.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Oricorio}}.
*{{m|Safeguard}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Oricorio}} can learn.
*'''Zzzap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Genesis|Pichu|12}} from {{TCG|Neo Genesis}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

